        "reason": "One step of a Stepper, its description says: its Stepper Indicator and label (round, the label under the circle), or its numbered label over a line (horizontal). Drawn with the shared layer helpers on both platforms; a part of a Stepper, not used on its own. Its status is the Stepper's to give, from its active step (owner decision 2026-09-24)."
